Speex ALSA runtime

This directory contains target libraries built from the following upstream
sources by scripts/build_base_audio_deps.sh:

  SpeexDSP 1.2.1
    https://downloads.xiph.org/releases/speex/speexdsp-1.2.1.tar.gz
    SHA-256: 8c777343e4a6399569c72abc38a95b24db56882c83dbdb6c6424a5f4aeb54d3d
    License: BSD-style; see the SpeexDSP COPYING file.

  alsa-plugins 1.2.12 (rate-speexrate module only)
    https://www.alsa-project.org/files/pub/plugins/alsa-plugins-1.2.12.tar.bz2
    SHA-256: 7bd8a83d304e8e2d86a25895d8dcb0ef0245a8df32e271959cdbdc6af39b66f2
    License: LGPL-2.1-or-later; see the alsa-plugins COPYING file.

The committed ELF files are MIPS32r2, little-endian, o32 hard-float target
builds. They are stripped for the device image. The generated ALSA module's
build-directory RPATH was removed before it was committed.

